Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Authentication|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Import LDAP User With Blank Password
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|apacheds.blank.user.password.enabled|true|
	And these properties
		|apacheds.enabled|true|
	And these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|AuthenticationUsecase#ImportLDAPUserWithBlankPassword|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings enable LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings view Enabled LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings enable LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|IMPORT_ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings view Enabled LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|IMPORT_ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings enable LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|IMPORT_ON_STARTUP_ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings view Enabled LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|IMPORT_ON_STARTUP_ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings enable LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|USE_LDAP_PASSWORD_POLICY|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings view Enabled LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|USE_LDAP_PASSWORD_POLICY|
	And PortalSettings add LDAP Server
		|LDAPServerName|ApacheDS Server|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings edit LDAP Server
		|LDAPServerName|ApacheDS Server|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Foundation|
	And SystemSettings edit Configuration
		|configurationName|LDAP Import|
	And SystemSettings enable Setting
		|checkboxSetting|IMPORT_ENABLED_CHECKBOX|
	And SystemSettings save Configuration
	And AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'Unable to encrypt blank password'
	And Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User view CP
		|userEmailAddress|ldapuseremail@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|ldapusergivenname|
		|userLastName|ldapusersn|
		|userScreenName|ldapusercn|
	Then AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'Unable to encrypt blank password'